119801bb2a4cc72e28b8f5466697b59330b5869ebaa8739de5434867b28b"},"walkthrough_content":"# Walkthrough: SUB-2179\n\n## Overview\nAligned session discovery, streaming transcript metrics, trajectory inference, and Sentinel invariant auditing across Antigravity 2.0 (`~/.gemini/antigravity/brain`), legacy AGY-IDE, Claude Code, and OpenCode without altering compiled `@intent` contract structs.\n\n## Changes\n- `substrate/src/nomos/modules/session/provider_agy_ide.go`: Added `ResolveRoots` discovering sessions across both Antigravity 2.0 (`antigravity/brain`) and legacy (`antigravity-ide/brain`) directories with UUID deduplication and `repoRoot` propagation.\n- `substrate/src/nomos/modules/session/provider_agy_cli.go`: Propagated `repoRoot` into brain session parsing for accurate repository attribution.\n- `substrate/src/nomos/modules/session/brain_common.go`: Added `parseBrainSessionDirWithRepo` and `resolveBrainSessionAcrossRoots` preferring the most recently updated transcript.\n- `substrate/src/nomos/modules/session/session_metrics.go`: Replaced fixed-buffer `Scanner`/`ReadLine` chunking with streaming `ReadBytes('\\n')` (`readStreamLines`) and discarded truncated leading fragments on non-zero tail seeks.\n- `substrate/src/nomos/modules/session/session_sentinel.go`: Normalized `parseSingleInvocation` across AGY 2.0 (`Path`), Claude Code (`command`, `file_path`), and OpenCode (`filePath`, `workdir`) argument keys.\n- `substrate/src/nomos/modules/session/provider_claude_parser.go`: Preserved all parallel `tool_use` blocks per assistant turn for Sentinel evaluation and extracted native `thinking` blocks.\n- `substrate/src/nomos/modules/session/session_detail.go`: Added AGY 2.0, Claude Code, and OpenCode tool names and path/query argument keys to `significantToolNames` and `extractToolDetail`.\n- `substrate/src/nomos/modules/session/session_trajectory.go`: Expanded exploration and implementation tool markers across all Tier 1 harnesses and restricted `inferOracleStage` to te